{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03886","headline":"有所思 · 贾曾","name":"有所思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳城东桃李花，飞来飞去落谁家。\n幽闺女儿爱颜色，坐见落花长叹息。\n今岁花开君不待，明年花开复谁在。\n故人不共洛阳东，今来空对落花风。\n年年岁岁花相似，岁岁年年人不同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03886.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03886","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}